#: ../../cluster.rst:401
msgid ""
"Compare the obvious rule, the owner :math:`h \\bmod n` for a hash "
":math:`h`. Going from three nodes to four, a client stays only when "
":math:`h \\bmod 3 = h \\bmod 4`. Both residues are fixed by :math:`h "
"\\bmod 12`, and they agree for :math:`h \\bmod 12 \\in \\{0, 1, 2\\}` "
"only: three residues of twelve. So three quarters of the clients move, "
"most of them between old nodes."
msgstr ""
"与显而易见的规则比较：对哈希 :math:`h`，所有者为 :math:`h \\bmod n`。从三个节点变为四个节点时，只有当 "
":math:`h \\bmod 3 = h \\bmod 4` 时客户端才会留下。两个余数都由 :math:`h \\bmod 12` "
"决定，并且只在 :math:`h \\bmod 12 \\in \\{0, 1, 2\\}` "
"时一致：十二个余数中只有三个。因此四分之三的客户端会迁移，其中大部分是在旧节点之间迁移。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:403
msgid "Implementation: ``Peering::owner_among``"
msgstr "实现：``Peering::owner_among``"

#: ../../cluster.rst:405
msgid ""
"The scan that names the owner of a client among this node and the "
"eligible peers, given as a bit set. In ``crates/lb/src/forward.rs`` "
"(crate ``sibuna-lb``). It returns ``None`` when this node owns the client."
msgstr ""
"在本节点和以位集给出的合格对等节点中，找出客户端所有者的扫描。位于 ``crates/lb/src/forward.rs``\\ （crate "
"``sibuna-lb``）。当本节点拥有该客户端时，它返回 ``None``。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:407
msgid ""
"let key = client_key(client);\n"
"let mut best = (wyhash::hash(self.seed, &key), self.rank);\n"
"let mut owner = None;\n"
"let mut left = eligible;\n"
"while left != 0 {\n"
"    let index = left.trailing_zeros() as usize;\n"
"    left &= left - 1;\n"
"    let Some(peer) = self.peers.get(index) else { break };\n"
"    let score = wyhash::hash(peer.seed, &key);\n"
"    // Equal scores go to the node that is earlier in the roster.\n"
"    if score > best.0 || (score == best.0 && peer.rank < best.1) {\n"
"        best = (score, peer.rank);\n"
"        owner = Some(index);\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../cluster.rst:425
msgid "One hop, and what it does not repair"
msgstr "一跳，以及它不能修复的问题"

#: ../../cluster.rst:428
msgid ""
"A peer is eligible when it can take a flow now. The mesh probes do not "
"show that, because another thread answers them on another port, so the "
"edge worker probes the forwarding port itself every 500 ms. A peer is "
"alive when it answered within 1.5 s and does not drain. A peer that "
"refused a flow or failed a connect is held back for one second."
msgstr ""
"当对等节点此刻能够接受一个流时，它是合格的。网格探测无法表明这一点，因为应答探测的是另一个端口上的另一个线程，所以边缘 worker 每 500 "
"ms 亲自探测一次转发端口。对等节点在 1.5 s 内应答且未处于排空状态时视为存活。拒绝过流或连接失败的对等节点会被暂缓一秒。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:430
msgid ""
"For a TCP or HTTP connection the receiving node first applies its own "
"checks: drain, its connection rate, a free flow slot. It then computes "
"the owner. If the owner is another eligible peer, it connects to the "
"owner's forwarding port, from its mesh address, and writes a header of 76 "
"bytes: the epoch of the owner, the frontend, the client and the "
"destination, and a tag over the two socket addresses of this connection "
"and the header. The owner answers 17 bytes: take, decline, or deny. On "
"take, the receiving node relays bytes both ways and never looks at them; "
"TLS, parsing, the firewall and the choice of a server happen on the "
"owner. On decline, a failed connect or a timeout of ``connect_timeout`` "
"(250 ms by default), it serves the connection itself. On deny, the "
"owner's rate limit refused the client, and the connection is closed: "
"otherwise every other node would serve a client above its limit. UDP "
"datagrams travel between a header and a tag on one socket, and replies "
"return through the node that the client reached, so the client sees the "
"answer come from the address it sent to."
msgstr ""
"对于 TCP 或 HTTP "
"连接，接收节点首先执行自己的检查：排空、自身的连接速率、空闲的流槽位。然后它计算所有者。如果所有者是另一个合格的对等节点，它就从自己的网格地址连接所有者的转发端口，并写入一个 "
"76 字节的头部：所有者的纪元、前端、客户端和目的地址，以及一个覆盖此连接两个套接字地址和头部的标签。所有者以 17 "
"字节应答：接受、谢绝或拒绝。接受时，接收节点双向中继字节，从不查看它们；TLS、解析、防火墙和服务器选择都在所有者上进行。谢绝、连接失败或 "
"``connect_timeout``\\ （默认 250 "
"ms）超时时，它自己服务这个连接。拒绝时，说明所有者的速率限制拒绝了该客户端，连接被关闭：否则其他每个节点都会为一个超出其限制的客户端提供服务。UDP "
"数据报在同一个套接字上以头部和标签包裹传输，回复经由客户端到达的那个节点返回，因此客户端看到应答来自它所发往的地址。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:432
msgid ""
"Two rules make this safe. A flow that arrived from a peer is served where "
"it lands and is never forwarded again, whatever that node believes about "
"the owner, so no flow takes more than one extra hop and none can loop. "
"And no flow is lost to forwarding: when the owner is down, declines, or "
"is at ``max_flows_per_peer``, the receiving node serves. The model "
"``docs/sid/assets/peer-forwarding.lean`` proves ``one_hop`` and "
"``forwarded_is_served`` for every belief of every node, ``owner_unique`` "
"for two nodes with the same view, and ``owner_after_join``: a node that "
"joins becomes the owner or changes nothing. On loopback a forwarded "
"connection cost 79 to 91 us more to its first line, and an exchange on an "
"established connection 19 to 21 us more."
msgstr ""
"两条规则保证了这样做是安全的。从对等节点到达的流在它落地的地方得到服务，永远不会再次转发，无论该节点对所有者有何判断，因此没有流会多走一跳以上，也没有流会形成循环。并且没有流会因转发而丢失：当所有者宕机、谢绝或达到 "
"``max_flows_per_peer`` 时，由接收节点提供服务。模型 "
"``docs/sid/assets/peer-forwarding.lean`` 对每个节点的每种判断证明了 ``one_hop`` 和 "
"``forwarded_is_served``，对视图相同的两个节点证明了 ``owner_unique``，还证明了 "
"``owner_after_join``：加入的节点要么成为所有者，要么不改变任何东西。在回环接口上，转发的连接到达其第一行要多花 79 到 91 "
"us，已建立连接上的一次交换要多花 19 到 21 us。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:434
msgid ""
"Forwarding keeps the *node* of a client, not a TCP connection. When the "
"router moves the packets of an established TCP connection to another "
"node, that node holds no socket for it and answers with a reset; the "
"client's next connection reaches its owner. Repairing the connection "
"would need its state on every node or a packet-level forward, and neither "
"is built. HTTP/3 is served by the node that receives its packets, a "
"frontend with ``proxy_protocol`` is not forwarded, and forwarding runs "
"only in the regional regime of the mesh, which a node leaves when the "
"95th percentile of the measured round trip to its peers exceeds 3 ms and "
"enters again from the wide-area regime only when it falls below 1.5 ms."
msgstr ""
"转发保持的是客户端的\\ *节点*\\ ，而不是一个 TCP 连接。当路由器把一个已建立 TCP "
"连接的数据包转到另一个节点时，那个节点没有对应的套接字，会以复位应答；客户端的下一个连接会到达其所有者。修复这个连接需要在每个节点上保存其状态，或进行数据包级别的转发，两者都未实现。HTTP/3 "
"由接收其数据包的节点提供服务，带 ``proxy_protocol`` "
"的前端不会被转发，并且转发只在网格的区域模式下运行：当到对等节点的实测往返时间的第 95 百分位超过 3 ms 时，节点离开区域模式，只有当它降到 "
"1.5 ms 以下时才从广域模式重新进入。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:436
msgid "Exercise 9.4"
msgstr "练习 9.4"

#: ../../cluster.rst:438
msgid ""
"A cluster of four nodes owns 1,000 clients evenly. (a) A fifth node "
"joins: how many clients move in expectation, and where to? (b) Instead, "
"node B leaves: which clients move, and where? (c) How many would move "
"from four to five nodes under :math:`h \\bmod n`?"
msgstr ""
"一个由四个节点组成的集群均匀地拥有 1,000 个客户端。(a) 第五个节点加入：期望有多少客户端迁移，迁移到哪里？(b) 改为节点 B "
"离开：哪些客户端迁移，迁移到哪里？(c) 在 :math:`h \\bmod n` 下，从四个节点变为五个节点时有多少客户端会迁移？"

#: ../../cluster.rst:440
msgid ""
"Hint: For (c), count the residues of :math:`h \\bmod 20` at which "
":math:`h \\bmod 4 = h \\bmod 5`."
msgstr ""
"提示：对于 (c)，统计 :math:`h \\bmod 20` 的哪些余数满足 :math:`h \\bmod 4 = h \\bmod 5`。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:444
msgid ""
"Explain why a join under rendezvous hashing moves only the clients that "
"the new node now owns, why a forwarded flow is never forwarded again, and "
"why neither rule can save an established TCP connection whose packets the "
"router sends to another node."
msgstr ""
"解释为什么在 rendezvous "
"哈希下，一次加入只迁移新节点现在拥有的客户端，为什么转发的流永远不会再次转发，以及为什么这两条规则都无法挽救一个数据包被路由器发往另一个节点的已建立 "
"TCP 连接。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:446
msgid "A Disk Under the Sticky Table"
msgstr "粘性表之下的磁盘"

#: ../../cluster.rst:449
msgid ""
"The sticky table forgets twice: when more clients come than it has slots, "
"and when the daemon restarts. SID 0027 puts a second tier under it, a "
"file of fixed size that the crate ``sibuna-spill`` maps into memory. "
"Every choice that the table stores is offered to the file, and a lookup "
"that finds nothing in memory asks the file. A hint from the file is a "
"wish: the pool uses it only for a new flow and only when the named server "
"may serve now. No ban, no counter and no live flow depends on the file."
msgstr ""
"粘性表会在两种情况下遗忘：客户端多于它的槽数时，以及守护进程重启时。SID 0027 在它下面加了第二层，即一个固定大小的文件，由 crate "
"``sibuna-spill`` "
"映射到内存中。表存储的每个选择都会提供给文件，在内存中找不到的查找会询问文件。来自文件的提示只是一个愿望：服务器池只对新流使用它，并且只在所指定的服务器此刻可以服务时才使用。没有任何封禁、计数器或活动流依赖于这个文件。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:451
msgid "The file and its slots"
msgstr "文件及其槽"

#: ../../cluster.rst:454
msgid ""
"The file starts with two pages of 4,096 bytes, the header and one write "
"counter for each of 64 shards, and continues with :math:`64 \\times B "
"\\times 4` slots of 64 bytes. A slot holds a checksum of 8 bytes, an "
"expiry of 8, a stamp of 4, the two lengths, two bytes of zero, a key of "
"24 bytes and a value of 16. The checksum is a wyhash over the other 56 "
"bytes, seeded with the random salt of the file and the number of the "
"slot, so a slot copied to another place or into another file fails its "
"check. A reader takes an entry only from a live slot: its lengths are in "
"range, its padding is zero, its checksum matches, and its expiry lies "
"after now and at most the longest lifetime after now. A slot that fails "
"is free space and is counted. One storage thread owns the mapping, copies "
"one slot in or out for each access, and serves the workers through a "
"bounded queue: a worker never touches the file, never waits for it, and a "
"full queue drops the work and counts it."
msgstr ""
"文件以两个 4,096 字节的页开始，即头部和 64 个分片各自的写计数器，接着是 :math:`64 \\times B \\times 4` "
"个 64 字节的槽。一个槽包含 8 字节的校验和、8 字节的过期时间、4 字节的时间戳、两个长度、两个零字节、24 字节的键和 16 "
"字节的值。校验和是对其余 56 字节计算的 "
"wyhash，以文件的随机盐和槽号为种子，因此被复制到另一个位置或另一个文件中的槽无法通过检查。读者只从有效的槽中取条目：长度在范围内，填充为零，校验和匹配，过期时间在当前时间之后且不超过当前时间加最长有效期。检查失败的槽视为空闲空间，并被计数。一个存储线程拥有这个映射，每次访问复制进或复制出一个槽，并通过一个有界队列服务 "
"worker：worker 从不接触文件，从不等待它，队列已满时丢弃工作并计数。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:456
msgid "Admission by frequency"
msgstr "按频率准入"

#: ../../cluster.rst:459
msgid ""
"A bucket of four slots is often full. A new key then competes with a "
"victim, the live slot whose key was seen least often, and wins only when "
"its estimated frequency exceeds the victim's. This is TinyLFU (Einziger, "
"Friedman and Manes, 2017). A key offered once cannot displace an entry "
"seen once or more, so a flood of new clients does not wash out the "
"clients in use. The frequency comes from a count-min sketch for each "
"shard: a table of :math:`m` four-bit counters, eight for each slot of the "
"shard rounded down to a power of two. A key touches four of them, chosen "
"by double hashing. Its estimate is the smallest of the four. A count "
"raises only the counters that equal that smallest value; this "
"*conservative update* keeps every counter at or below what a plain sketch "
"would hold, and no counter ever below the true count. After four counts "
"for each slot of the shard, every counter is halved, so a key must keep "
"returning to keep its estimate."
msgstr ""
"四个槽的桶经常是满的。这时新键要与一个牺牲者竞争，即其键被见到次数最少的有效槽，并且只有当新键的估计频率超过牺牲者时才能胜出。这就是 "
"TinyLFU（Einziger、Friedman 和 "
"Manes，2017）。只出现过一次的键无法取代被见到一次或多次的条目，因此大量新客户端涌入不会冲走正在使用的客户端。频率来自每个分片的 "
"count-min sketch：一张有 :math:`m` 个四位计数器的表，每个分片槽对应八个计数器，向下取整为 2 "
"的幂。一个键通过双重哈希选中其中四个计数器。它的估计值是这四个中的最小值。一次计数只增加等于该最小值的计数器；这种\\ *保守更新*\\ "
"使每个计数器都不超过普通 sketch "
"会持有的值，并且没有任何计数器低于真实计数。当计数次数达到分片槽数的四倍后，每个计数器减半，因此一个键必须不断出现才能保持其估计值。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:461
msgid ""
"The classical bound of Cormode and Muthukrishnan explains why the "
"estimate is good. Let :math:`N` keys be counted. Fix a key :math:`x` and "
"one of its counters. Every count of another key raises at most four "
"counters, each at a position that ideal hashing makes uniform over "
":math:`m`, so it raises this counter with probability at most "
":math:`4/m`. The expected excess of the counter is therefore"
msgstr ""
"Cormode 和 Muthukrishnan 的经典上界解释了为什么这个估计是好的。设对 :math:`N` 个键进行计数。固定一个键 "
":math:`x` 及其一个计数器。其他键的每次计数至多增加四个计数器，每个计数器的位置在理想哈希下在 :math:`m` "
"上均匀分布，因此它增加这个计数器的概率至多为 :math:`4/m`。于是该计数器的期望超额为"

#: ../../cluster.rst:463
msgid "\\lambda \\le \\frac{4N}{m}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../cluster.rst:467
msgid ""
"By Markov's inequality the excess reaches :math:`t` with probability at "
"most :math:`\\lambda/t`. The estimate is the smallest of four counters, "
"so it is too high by :math:`t` only when all four are; treating the four "
"as independent, which ideal hashing makes nearly true, that probability "
"is at most :math:`(\\lambda/t)^4`. The excess is a sum of many rare hits, "
"so it is close to a Poisson variable with mean :math:`\\lambda`, which "
"gives a sharper estimate than Markov's bound."
msgstr ""
"由 Markov 不等式，超额达到 :math:`t` 的概率至多为 "
":math:`\\lambda/t`。估计值是四个计数器中的最小值，因此只有当四个都偏高时它才会偏高 "
":math:`t`；把这四个视为独立的（理想哈希使这几乎成立），这一概率至多为 "
":math:`(\\lambda/t)^4`。超额是许多罕见命中之和，因此它接近一个均值为 :math:`\\lambda` 的 Poisson "
"变量，由此得到比 Markov 上界更精确的估计。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:469
msgid "Worked example: the error of the sketch"
msgstr "实例分析：sketch 的误差"

#: ../../cluster.rst:471
msgid ""
"A file of ``64m`` holds 1,048,064 slots (Part XI), so a shard holds "
":math:`S = 16{,}376`. Eight counters for each slot would be 131,008. The "
"largest power of two below that is :math:`m = 2^{16} = 65{,}536`, four "
"counters for each slot: 32 KiB for the shard and 2 MiB for the file, two "
"bytes for each slot. The sketch halves after :math:`4S = 65{,}504` counts."
msgstr ""
"``64m`` 的文件有 1,048,064 个槽（第 XI 部分），因此一个分片有 :math:`S = 16{,}376` "
"个槽。每个槽八个计数器就是 131,008 个。小于它的最大的 2 的幂是 :math:`m = 2^{16} = "
"65{,}536`，即每个槽四个计数器：每个分片 32 KiB，整个文件 2 MiB，每个槽两字节。sketch 在 :math:`4S = "
"65{,}504` 次计数后减半。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:473
msgid ""
"We take the first window after a start, when the sketch begins at zero, "
"and look at its middle, :math:`N = 2S = 32{,}752` counts. Then "
":math:`\\lambda \\le 4 \\times 32{,}752 / 65{,}536 \\approx 2`. A key "
"seen once can displace a victim seen four times only if its estimate is "
"at least 5, an excess of :math:`t = 4` on all four counters. Markov's "
"bound gives at most :math:`(2/4)^4 = 1/16`. The Poisson estimate is "
"sharper:"
msgstr ""
"我们取启动后的第一个窗口，此时 sketch 从零开始，并考察窗口中间，即 :math:`N = 2S = 32{,}752` 次计数。于是 "
":math:`\\lambda \\le 4 \\times 32{,}752 / 65{,}536 \\approx "
"2`。只见过一次的键要取代见过四次的牺牲者，其估计值必须至少为 5，即四个计数器上都有 :math:`t = 4` 的超额。Markov "
"上界给出至多 :math:`(2/4)^4 = 1/16`。Poisson 估计更精确："

#: ../../cluster.rst:475
msgid ""
"P(X \\ge 4) = 1 - e^{-2}\\Big(1 + 2 + 2 + \\tfrac{4}{3}\\Big) = 1 - "
"0.1353 \\times 6.333 \\approx 0.143, \\qquad 0.143^4 \\approx 4.2 \\times "
"10^{-4}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../cluster.rst:479
msgid ""
"So about four keys seen once in ten thousand look like keys seen five "
"times, at the middle of the first window. Later windows begin from halved "
"counters, so the plain bound for them is up to twice as large, and the "
"rounding of :math:`m` down to a power of two can halve the counters of a "
"shard. The conservative update only lowers these numbers. The bound is a "
"model, and the measurement is the evidence: under a flood of 16,776,192 "
"new keys, a file of 256 MiB kept all but 10 to 15 of the about 1,044,000 "
"keys of a working set that it held before the flood."
msgstr ""
"因此，在第一个窗口的中间，大约万分之四只见过一次的键看起来像见过五次的键。之后的窗口从减半的计数器开始，因此它们的普通上界至多是这个值的两倍，而把 "
":math:`m` 向下取整为 2 的幂可能使一个分片的计数器减半。保守更新只会降低这些数字。上界是一个模型，测量才是证据：在 "
"16,776,192 个新键的洪泛下，一个 256 MiB 的文件保住了洪泛前它所持有的约 1,044,000 个工作集键中的绝大部分，只丢失了 "
"10 到 15 个。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:481
msgid "Implementation: ``Sketch::touch``"
msgstr "实现：``Sketch::touch``"

#: ../../cluster.rst:483
msgid ""
"Counts one key with the conservative update and ages the sketch when its "
"sample is full. In ``crates/spill/src/sketch.rs`` (crate "
"``sibuna-spill``). ``Sketch::estimate`` returns the smallest of the four "
"counters."
msgstr ""
"以保守更新对一个键计数，并在样本满时让 sketch 老化。位于 ``crates/spill/src/sketch.rs``\\ （crate "
"``sibuna-spill``）。``Sketch::estimate`` 返回四个计数器中的最小值。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:485
msgid ""
"pub fn touch(&mut self, hash: u64) {\n"
"    let least = u64::from(self.estimate(hash));\n"
"    for row in 0..ROWS {\n"
"        let (word, shift) = self.counter(hash, row);\n"
"        if let Some(word) = self.words.get_mut(word)\n"
"            && least < CEILING\n"
"            && (*word >> shift) & CEILING == least\n"
"        {\n"
"            *word += 1 << shift;\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"    self.counted += 1;\n"
"    if self.counted >= self.sample {\n"
"        self.age();\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../cluster.rst:504
msgid ""
"The two tiers meet in ``SpillStore`` (``crates/lb/src/hints.rs``), which "
"implements the trait ``AffinityStore`` of SID 0025 with the table in "
"front. A lookup that misses memory asks the disk and does not wait: the "
"flow goes on with the balanced choice, a *guess*, and the answer of the "
"disk replaces the guess with an end one millisecond later, so it wins "
"here and on every node the mesh tells. A guess takes only a free slot on "
"disk and does not count in the sketch, so no number of guesses displaces "
"a hint. With 2,000,000 clients, thirty times a table of 65,536 slots, "
"97.0 percent had their choice at their second lookup. After a restart of "
"both nodes of a two-host mesh, the first flow of 300 clients found "
"another server for 191 of them, and the second flow found the remembered "
"server for all 300."
msgstr ""
"两层在 ``SpillStore``\\ （``crates/lb/src/hints.rs``）中汇合，它以表在前的方式实现 SID 0025 "
"的 trait ``AffinityStore``。在内存中未命中的查找会询问磁盘而不等待：流继续使用均衡得出的选择，即一个\\ *猜测*\\ "
"，磁盘的回答用一个晚一毫秒的结束时间取代这个猜测，因此它在本节点以及网格通知到的每个节点上胜出。猜测只占用磁盘上的空闲槽，不计入 "
"sketch，因此无论多少猜测都不会取代一个提示。在 2,000,000 个客户端（是 65,536 个槽的表的三十倍）下，97.0% "
"的客户端在第二次查找时就找到了自己的选择。在一个双主机网格的两个节点都重启之后，300 个客户端的第一个流中有 191 "
"个找到了另一台服务器，而第二个流全部 300 个都找到了记住的服务器。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:506
msgid "Crash safety, memory and the file system"
msgstr "崩溃安全、内存与文件系统"

#: ../../cluster.rst:509
msgid ""
"A new file is never created in place. The function ``create`` in "
"``crates/spill/src/open.rs`` removes whatever lies at the path with "
"``.tmp`` after it, without writing through it, builds a complete file "
"there with every block written and the header last, and renames it over "
"the path. A rename replaces one name with another in one step, so the "
"path names no file, a foreign file or a complete file, and never a "
"half-made one. A file without the magic is never overwritten: the daemon "
"refuses to start and names it. Writes go through the mapping and are "
"flushed when the daemon stops. A crash of the process loses nothing "
"written, because the pages belong to the kernel. A loss of power may "
"leave each page old, new or mixed; a mixed slot fails its checksum and "
"costs its hint, and an old slot is a valid older hint, which the pool "
"checks before use."
msgstr ""
"新文件从不就地创建。``crates/spill/src/open.rs`` 中的函数 ``create`` 删除路径后加 ``.tmp`` "
"处的任何东西（不经由它写入），在那里构建一个完整的文件，写入每个块，最后写头部，然后把它重命名覆盖到该路径上。重命名一步就把一个名称替换为另一个，因此该路径要么不指向任何文件，要么指向一个外来文件或一个完整的文件，从不指向半成品。没有魔数的文件从不被覆盖：守护进程拒绝启动并指出该文件。写入经由映射进行，并在守护进程停止时刷写。进程崩溃不会丢失任何已写入的内容，因为这些页属于内核。断电可能使每个页处于旧、新或混合状态；混合的槽无法通过校验和，损失其提示；旧的槽是一个有效的较旧提示，服务器池在使用前会检查它。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:511
msgid ""
"Two properties of the host matter. The pages of the file count as memory "
"of the process. Under a memory limit below the size of the file, a 256 "
"MiB file under 96 MiB was killed by the kernel in three runs on one host, "
"and on another host reached the limit 410,479 times and did not finish "
"its first phase in 17 minutes. The workers keep serving by the balanced "
"choice, but the disk tier is useless or the daemon dies, so a limit must "
"lie above the file plus the daemon. And every block is written at "
"creation so that a full disk is found at start, but a file system that "
"compresses or copies on write breaks that promise: on ZFS with "
"compression a new file of 16,769,024 bytes took 141 KiB. When such a file "
"system fills later, a write through the mapping raises a signal that ends "
"the daemon. Part XI gives the settings for systemd, Docker and Kubernetes."
msgstr ""
"主机的两个特性很重要。文件的页计为进程的内存。在低于文件大小的内存限制下，一个 256 MiB 的文件在 96 MiB "
"的限制下，在一台主机上三次运行都被内核杀死，在另一台主机上达到限制 410,479 次，并且 17 分钟内都没有完成第一阶段。worker "
"继续按均衡选择提供服务，但磁盘层变得无用或者守护进程终止，因此限制必须高于文件加上守护进程的大小。并且创建时会写入每个块，以便在启动时就发现磁盘已满，但压缩或写时复制的文件系统会打破这一保证：在启用压缩的 "
"ZFS 上，一个 16,769,024 字节的新文件只占用 141 "
"KiB。当这样的文件系统之后被写满时，经由映射的写入会引发一个信号，使守护进程终止。第 XI 部分给出了 systemd、Docker 和 "
"Kubernetes 的设置。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:513
msgid "Exercise 9.5"
msgstr "练习 9.5"

#: ../../cluster.rst:515
msgid ""
"A shard whose slot count lies just under a power of two keeps the full "
"eight counters for each slot. Compute :math:`\\lambda` at the middle and "
"at the end of the first window, and the Poisson estimate that a key seen "
"once reaches an estimate of 5 at each point."
msgstr ""
"槽数略低于 2 的幂的分片保留每个槽完整的八个计数器。计算第一个窗口中间和末尾的 "
":math:`\\lambda`，以及在这两个时刻只见过一次的键的估计值达到 5 的 Poisson 估计。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:517
msgid ""
"Hint: Only the ratio :math:`N/m` matters. At :math:`\\lambda = 1`, "
":math:`e^{-1} \\approx 0.3679`."
msgstr ""
"提示：只有比值 :math:`N/m` 起作用。当 :math:`\\lambda = 1` 时，:math:`e^{-1} \\approx "
"0.3679`。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:521
msgid ""
"Explain why a torn, copied or foreign slot can cost a hint and never "
"choose a server that may not serve, why the path never names a half-made "
"file, and why the sketch may overestimate a frequency but never "
"underestimate it."
msgstr ""
"解释为什么撕裂、复制或外来的槽可能损失一个提示，却永远不会选中一台不能服务的服务器；为什么该路径从不指向半成品文件；以及为什么 sketch "
"可能高估频率，却从不低估。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:523
msgid "A Database as the Authority"
msgstr "以数据库为权威"

#: ../../cluster.rst:526
msgid ""
"SID 0023 sends one file to the peers. Two operators who send two files at "
"the same time each win on some nodes, a node that was down keeps its old "
"file, and there is no history. SID 0028 lets a database hold the "
"published topology. The file of each node keeps what belongs to its host, "
"``global``, ``mesh`` and ``observability``, and a section ``authority`` "
"that names the database; the database holds ``frontends``, ``backends`` "
"and ``http``. Each revision is one canonical JSON document with its "
"SHA-256 digest, so a node reads a revision whole with one statement and "
"refuses one whose digest does not match."
msgstr ""
"SID 0023 把一个文件发送给对等节点。两个运维人员同时发送两个文件时，各自会在一些节点上胜出；宕机的节点保留旧文件；也没有历史。SID "
"0028 让数据库保存已发布的拓扑。每个节点的文件保留属于其主机的内容，即 ``global``、``mesh`` 和 "
"``observability``，以及一个指定数据库的 ``authority`` 部分；数据库保存 "
"``frontends``、``backends`` 和 ``http``。每个修订版本是一个带 SHA-256 摘要的规范 JSON "
"文档，因此节点用一条语句就能完整地读取一个修订版本，并拒绝摘要不匹配的修订版本。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:528
msgid ""
"The revisions are numbered 1, 2, 3 without a gap, and a committed "
"revision never changes. ``sibuna authority apply`` evaluates a source, "
"checks it, prints the difference to the head and commits on one "
"condition: the head is still the revision it read. The commit is one "
"transaction of two statements."
msgstr ""
"修订版本编号为 1、2、3，没有间隙，已提交的修订版本永不改变。``sibuna authority apply`` "
"对源进行求值、检查，打印与头部修订版本的差异，并在一个条件下提交：头部仍然是它读到的那个修订版本。提交是一个包含两条语句的事务。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:530
msgid ""
"UPDATE edge_head SET revision = :expected + 1 WHERE id = 1 AND revision = "
":expected\n"
"INSERT INTO edge_revisions (revision, ...) VALUES (:expected + 1, ...)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../cluster.rst:535
msgid ""
"When the first statement changes no row, the head moved, and the command "
"fails with ``DBA002 REVISION CONFLICT`` and commits nothing. This is a "
"compare-and-set on one row. Of two writers that read the same head, "
"PostgreSQL makes the second wait for the row lock, after which it finds "
"the new head and changes nothing. A condition on \"the head, whatever it "
"is\" would protect nothing: the command conditions on the head against "
"which it printed the difference, so what the operator saw is what the "
"commit replaces. A rollback commits a new revision with an earlier "
"document, because moving the head back would make \"applied 5\" ambiguous "
"between before and after 7."
msgstr ""
"当第一条语句没有修改任何行时，说明头部已经移动，命令以 ``DBA002 REVISION CONFLICT`` "
"失败，不提交任何内容。这是对一行的比较并设置。对于读到同一个头部的两个写者，PostgreSQL "
"让第二个等待行锁，之后它发现新的头部，不修改任何东西。以“头部，无论它是什么”为条件将什么也保护不了：命令以它打印差异时所对照的头部为条件，因此运维人员看到的正是提交所替换的内容。回滚会以一个较早的文档提交一个新的修订版本，因为把头部移回去会使“已应用 "
"5”在 7 之前和之后含义不明。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:537
msgid "Implementation: ``Store::commit``"
msgstr "实现：``Store::commit``"

#: ../../cluster.rst:539
msgid ""
"The trait ``Store`` has seven operations: ``head``, ``revision``, "
"``commit``, ``history``, ``report``, ``nodes`` and ``wait``. ``commit`` "
"stores a draft as revision ``expected + 1`` when the head is ``expected`` "
"and fails with a conflict otherwise. In ``crates/authority/src/store.rs`` "
"(crate ``sibuna-authority``). ``SqlStore`` in "
"``crates/authority/src/sql.rs`` implements it for SQLite and PostgreSQL, "
"and ``MemoryStore`` for the tests. ``commit_settled`` in ``store.rs`` "
"settles a commit whose connection failed by asking whether the head is "
"the new revision with the new digest."
msgstr ""
"trait ``Store`` "
"有七个操作：``head``、``revision``、``commit``、``history``、``report``、``nodes`` 和 "
"``wait``。当头部为 ``expected`` 时，``commit`` 把草稿存储为修订版本 ``expected + "
"1``，否则以冲突失败。位于 ``crates/authority/src/store.rs``\\ （crate "
"``sibuna-authority``）。``crates/authority/src/sql.rs`` 中的 ``SqlStore`` 为 "
"SQLite 和 PostgreSQL 实现它，``MemoryStore`` 用于测试。``store.rs`` 中的 "
"``commit_settled`` 通过询问头部是否为带新摘要的新修订版本，来确定一次连接失败的提交的结果。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:541
msgid ""
"Every node follows on a thread of its own, ``edge-authority``. It looks "
"at the head when PostgreSQL sends ``NOTIFY``, when its poll passes, at "
"``reload``, and when the worker has settled a revision. A new head is "
"read, composed with the node's file, checked, and left for the worker; "
"the node reports a revision as applied only after its worker serves it. A "
"node that cannot read the database keeps what it serves and asks again "
"after two seconds at most. A node that refuses a revision keeps the last "
"one that checked and reports why. With ``cache`` a node can restart while "
"the database is down. The nodes connect with a role that can read the "
"revisions and write only their own report, so a node that is taken over "
"cannot change the topology. The model "
"``docs/sid/assets/database-authority.lean`` proves that a commit on a "
"stale head changes nothing (``commit_conflict``), that of two writers on "
"one head the second fails (``second_commit_conflicts``), that a node only "
"ever serves a document that passed its check (``step_serves_valid``), and "
"that one look at a valid head brings a node to it, so a lost notification "
"costs one poll (``poll_converges``). On a debug build two nodes applied a "
"revision 128 to 155 ms after ``apply`` began with PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""
"每个节点都在自己的线程 ``edge-authority`` 上跟随。它在 PostgreSQL 发送 ``NOTIFY`` "
"时、轮询到期时、``reload`` 时，以及 worker 确定了一个修订版本时查看头部。新的头部被读取、与节点的文件组合、检查，然后留给 "
"worker；只有在其 worker "
"提供服务之后，节点才报告该修订版本已应用。无法读取数据库的节点保持它正在提供的内容，并在至多两秒后再次询问。拒绝某个修订版本的节点保持最后一个通过检查的修订版本，并报告原因。使用 "
"``cache`` 时，节点可以在数据库宕机期间重启。节点以一个只能读取修订版本、只能写入自己报告的角色连接，因此被接管的节点无法修改拓扑。模型 "
"``docs/sid/assets/database-authority.lean`` "
"证明了：在过期头部上的提交不改变任何东西（``commit_conflict``）；同一头部上的两个写者中第二个会失败（``second_commit_conflicts``）；节点只会提供通过了检查的文档（``step_serves_valid``）；对一个有效头部看一次就能让节点到达它，因此丢失一次通知只需付出一次轮询的代价（``poll_converges``）。在调试构建中，使用 "
"PostgreSQL 时，两个节点在 ``apply`` 开始后 128 到 155 ms 应用了一个修订版本。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:543
msgid "Exercise 9.6"
msgstr "练习 9.6"

#: ../../cluster.rst:545
msgid ""
"Two operators run ``diff`` against head 7 and then ``apply`` at the same "
"moment, one adding a server and one removing a frontend. What does each "
"see, what does the database hold afterwards, and what should the second "
"operator do? Why would an ``apply`` conditioned on the head at the time "
"of the commit be wrong?"
msgstr ""
"两个运维人员针对头部 7 运行 ``diff``，然后同时运行 "
"``apply``，一个添加一台服务器，一个删除一个前端。各自看到什么？之后数据库中保存的是什么？第二个运维人员应该怎么做？为什么以提交时刻的头部为条件的 "
"``apply`` 是错误的？"

#: ../../cluster.rst:547
msgid "Hint: Follow the ``UPDATE`` of each transaction under the row lock."
msgstr "提示：在行锁下跟踪每个事务的 ``UPDATE``。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:551
msgid ""
"Explain why the revisions have no gap and never change, why the last word "
"on whether a node serves a revision belongs to the node and not to the "
"command, and why a rollback appends instead of moving the head."
msgstr ""
"解释为什么修订版本没有间隙且永不改变，为什么节点是否提供某个修订版本的最终决定权属于节点而不属于命令，以及为什么回滚是追加而不是移动头部。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:553
msgid "Replacing the Binary"
msgstr "替换二进制程序"

#: ../../cluster.rst:556
msgid ""
"A new binary must take over without losing a connection that waits in a "
"listener and without moving a UDP client to another server. "
"``global.reuse_port`` lets a new process bind the same addresses, but the "
"old listener keeps its own accept queue until it closes, and the old "
"process refuses what it accepts while it drains. Under one load SID 0029 "
"counted 9,943 to 22,516 failed connections in a run with ``reuse_port``."
msgstr ""
"新的二进制程序必须在接管时既不丢失在监听器中等待的连接，也不把 UDP 客户端转移到另一台服务器。``global.reuse_port`` "
"让新进程能够绑定相同的地址，但旧监听器在关闭之前保留自己的接受队列，而旧进程在排空期间会拒绝它接受的连接。在一种负载下，SID 0029 "
"在一次使用 ``reuse_port`` 的运行中统计到 9,943 到 22,516 个失败的连接。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:558
msgid ""
"SID 0029 passes the sockets instead. The old process listens on a Unix "
"socket, ``global.upgrade_socket``. The replacement checks its file, "
"connects, and receives the listening sockets as descriptors in "
"``SCM_RIGHTS`` control messages of ``sendmsg``. Both ends check the "
"credentials of the peer with ``SO_PEERCRED`` and refuse another user."
msgstr ""
"SID 0029 改为传递套接字。旧进程在一个 Unix 套接字 ``global.upgrade_socket`` "
"上监听。替代进程检查自己的文件，建立连接，并以 ``sendmsg`` 的 ``SCM_RIGHTS`` "
"控制消息中的描述符形式接收监听套接字。两端都用 ``SO_PEERCRED`` 检查对端的凭据，并拒绝其他用户。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:560
msgid ""
"replacement                               old process\n"
"checks its file\n"
"connect, HELLO  ------------------------> checks the peer, chooses the "
"version\n"
"                <------------------------ LISTENERS with descriptors\n"
"builds the edge on them, reads nothing    accepts TCP, reads UDP as "
"before\n"
"READY  ---------------------------------> stops reading UDP\n"
"                <------------------------ FLOWS (mappings and server "
"sockets), COMMIT\n"
"adopts the mappings, accepts TCP          still accepts TCP\n"
"DONE  ----------------------------------> stops accepting, drains, exits "
"0\n"
"reads UDP, binds its admin socket"
msgstr ""

#: ../../cluster.rst:573
msgid ""
"Two invariants govern the cutover. At every instant some live process "
"accepts on each TCP listener: two acceptors on one socket lose nothing, "
"since each connection goes to one of them. And at most one process reads "
"a UDP socket: two readers would give the datagrams of one client to two "
"tables, so between READY and DONE nobody reads, and the kernel holds the "
"datagrams in the socket. The old process measures that interval; with "
"6,000 mappings it was 59 to 87 ms on a quiet machine. A failure before "
"DONE returns the service to the old process with every listener and "
"mapping it had. The old process resumes reading only when the connection "
"to the replacement is closed, because a deadline proves nothing: a "
"stopped replacement could wake and read beside it. So after 10 s without "
"DONE the old process ends the replacement and waits for the close."
msgstr ""
"两个不变量支配着切换过程。在每一时刻，每个 TCP "
"监听器上都有某个存活的进程在接受连接：一个套接字上有两个接受者不会丢失任何东西，因为每个连接都只会交给其中一个。并且至多一个进程读取 UDP "
"套接字：两个读者会把同一个客户端的数据报交给两张表，因此在 READY 和 DONE "
"之间没有人读取，内核把数据报保存在套接字中。旧进程测量这段间隔；在一台安静的机器上，6,000 个映射时为 59 到 87 ms。在 DONE "
"之前发生的失败会把服务交还给旧进程，连同它原有的每个监听器和映射。旧进程只有在与替代进程的连接关闭后才恢复读取，因为期限证明不了任何东西：一个被暂停的替代进程可能醒来并与它同时读取。因此在 "
"10 s 内没有收到 DONE 时，旧进程终止替代进程并等待连接关闭。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:575
msgid "Implementation: ``Giving::end_peer``"
msgstr "实现：``Giving::end_peer``"

#: ../../cluster.rst:577
msgid ""
"Ends a silent replacement and waits for its connection to close, which "
"proves that it reads no socket. In ``crates/upgrade/src/give.rs`` (crate "
"``sibuna-upgrade``). ``Giving::give_listeners`` in the same file sends "
"the listeners, and the foreign call ``sendmsg`` with ``SCM_RIGHTS`` is in "
"``crates/upgrade/src/sys.rs``, the only unsafe code of the record. On the "
"edge side, ``Edge::freeze_datagrams`` in ``crates/lb/src/handoff.rs`` "
"stops the UDP reads."
msgstr ""
"终止一个静默的替代进程，并等待其连接关闭，这证明它不再读取任何套接字。位于 ``crates/upgrade/src/give.rs``\\ "
"（crate ``sibuna-upgrade``）。同一文件中的 ``Giving::give_listeners`` 发送监听器，而带 "
"``SCM_RIGHTS`` 的外部调用 ``sendmsg`` 位于 "
"``crates/upgrade/src/sys.rs``，这是该记录中唯一的 unsafe "
"代码。在边缘一侧，``crates/lb/src/handoff.rs`` 中的 ``Edge::freeze_datagrams`` 停止 "
"UDP 读取。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:579
msgid ""
"pub fn end_peer(&mut self, patience: Duration) -> bool {\n"
"    // The signal can fail when the process is gone already. The closed "
"connection\n"
"    // is the proof either way.\n"
"    let _ = sys::end_process(self.peer.pid);\n"
"    self.channel.wait_closed(patience)\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../cluster.rst:588
msgid ""
"What is handed over: the TCP and UDP listeners, and every UDP mapping of "
"a ``udp`` frontend with its connected server socket, so the server sees "
"the same source port. In the tests no connection of 17,382 to 33,524 in a "
"run failed, in 27 runs, and a UDP client kept its server through two "
"upgrades. What is lost: a QUIC connection of HTTP/3, whose state lives in "
"the runtime of the old process; accepted TCP streams stay with the old "
"process until they end or until ``shutdown_timeout``. Rate counters, "
"health states, latency estimates, sticky tables and run-time commands "
"start anew. The handoff is built and tested on Linux only. Two limits "
"concern a cluster directly. The mesh socket and the forwarding port are "
"not passed, so a node of a mesh cannot be replaced this way; the "
"replacement should fail before READY and leave the old process serving, "
"and that path is not tested. And an adopted UDP mapping is not counted "
"against a fleet-wide cap, so a server may hold that many flows beyond its "
"limit until those mappings end. The model "
"``docs/sid/assets/upgrade-handoff.lean`` proves ``single_reader``, "
"``always_an_acceptor`` and ``failure_returns_service`` for the state "
"machine; it is not derived from the code."
msgstr ""
"交接的内容：TCP 和 UDP 监听器，以及 ``udp`` 前端的每个 UDP "
"映射连同其已连接的服务器套接字，因此服务器看到的源端口相同。在测试中，27 次运行里每次 17,382 到 33,524 "
"个连接都没有一个失败，一个 UDP 客户端经过两次升级仍保持其服务器。丢失的内容：HTTP/3 的 QUIC "
"连接，其状态存在于旧进程的运行时中；已接受的 TCP 流留在旧进程中，直到它们结束或达到 "
"``shutdown_timeout``。速率计数器、健康状态、延迟估计、粘性表和运行时命令从头开始。交接只在 Linux "
"上实现和测试。有两个限制直接涉及集群。网格套接字和转发端口不会被传递，因此网格中的节点无法用这种方式替换；替代进程应当在 READY "
"之前失败，让旧进程继续提供服务，而这条路径未经测试。此外，被接管的 UDP "
"映射不计入集群范围的上限，因此在这些映射结束之前，一台服务器可能持有超出其限制这么多的流。模型 "
"``docs/sid/assets/upgrade-handoff.lean`` 为该状态机证明了 "
"``single_reader``、``always_an_acceptor`` 和 "
"``failure_returns_service``；它并非从代码推导而来。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:592
msgid ""
"Explain why the TCP listeners may have two acceptors for an instant while "
"the UDP sockets must have none, and why the old process trusts a closed "
"connection and not a clock before it reads again."
msgstr ""
"解释为什么 TCP 监听器可以在一瞬间有两个接受者，而 UDP "
"套接字必须一个读者都没有；以及为什么旧进程在再次读取之前信任的是关闭的连接，而不是时钟。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:594
msgid "The Fleet in the Console"
msgstr "控制台中的集群"

#: ../../cluster.rst:597
msgid ""
"SID 0031 starts the console of SID 0007 beside the edge. Its ``console`` "
"section lists every member under ``nodes``, at most 64, so the section is "
"the same on all nodes and ``reload cluster`` can carry it. One page shows "
"the frontends, the backends and the fleet: ``GET "
"/console/api/edge/fleet`` asks every peer at once over the authenticated "
"stream of SID 0007, waits at most five seconds, and returns one row for "
"each member with the state of its link and the summary of its node. The "
"page runs the commands of the admin socket through the same parser and "
"worker, so it adds no power; a command needs the action ``control_node`` "
"and passes the session, ``Origin`` and CSRF checks, and the console keeps "
"the admin socket's limit of 20 commands in a burst and 10 a second. A "
"member removed from the file loses its stream within two seconds. The "
"criterion that the console costs the data plane less than one percent is "
"not established: under load the data plane lost 8 to 11 percent whether "
"the load fell on its own console or on that of another process, so the "
"measurement saw the cost of shared processors and not of the coupling."
msgstr ""
"SID 0031 在边缘旁边启动 SID 0007 的控制台。它的 ``console`` 部分在 ``nodes`` 下列出每个成员，至多 64 "
"个，因此这一部分在所有节点上都相同，并且可以由 ``reload cluster`` 携带。一个页面显示前端、后端和整个集群：``GET "
"/console/api/edge/fleet`` 通过 SID 0007 "
"的经过认证的流同时询问每个对等节点，至多等待五秒，并为每个成员返回一行，包含其链路状态和其节点的摘要。该页面通过同一个解析器和 worker "
"运行管理套接字的命令，因此不增加任何权限；一条命令需要 ``control_node`` 动作，并通过会话、``Origin`` 和 CSRF "
"检查，控制台保持管理套接字的限制：突发 20 条命令，每秒 10 "
"条。从文件中删除的成员在两秒内失去其流。控制台对数据平面的开销低于百分之一这一标准尚未确立：在负载下，无论负载落在它自己的控制台上还是另一个进程的控制台上，数据平面都损失了 "
"8% 到 11%，因此测量看到的是共享处理器的开销，而不是耦合的开销。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:599
msgid "What Three Hosts Measured"
msgstr "三台主机的测量结果"

#: ../../cluster.rst:602
msgid ""
"Part X records the cluster on three hosts with 16, 16 and 32 CPUs, in "
"containers on one network, each host running a node, an origin and a load "
"generator that loaded the node of the next host. After SID 0024, the "
"three nodes together carried 89,124 to 97,173 HTTP and 90,399 to 92,652 "
"HTTPS requests a second, 0.87 to 1.15 of what HAProxy carried in the same "
"setup, with 42 to 49 CPU seconds against HAProxy's 66 to 102, and no "
"request failed with either proxy. The network set the ceiling, and the "
"lines differ from run to run by more than the two proxies differ. On the "
"same hosts a ban reached the two other nodes in 20 to 64 ms, a lift in 13 "
"to 48 ms, and ``reload cluster`` returned with all three nodes holding "
"the same file in 30 ms, each time including the request that observed the "
"effect, sent every 5 ms. These are single runs on shared hosts; Part X "
"gives the tables and the method."
msgstr ""
"第 X 部分记录了集群在三台主机上的表现，三台主机分别有 16、16 和 32 个 "
"CPU，在同一网络中以容器运行，每台主机运行一个节点、一个源站和一个负载生成器，负载生成器向下一台主机的节点施加负载。在 SID 0024 "
"之后，三个节点合计每秒承载 89,124 到 97,173 个 HTTP 请求和 90,399 到 92,652 个 HTTPS "
"请求，是同一环境下 HAProxy 承载量的 0.87 到 1.15，使用 42 到 49 CPU 秒，而 HAProxy 为 66 到 "
"102，两个代理都没有失败的请求。网络决定了上限，而且各次运行之间的差异大于两个代理之间的差异。在同样的主机上，一次封禁在 20 到 64 ms "
"内到达另外两个节点，一次解除在 13 到 48 ms 内到达，``reload cluster`` 在 30 ms "
"内返回且三个节点都持有相同文件，每次都包括观察到效果的那个请求，请求每 5 ms 发送一次。这些都是在共享主机上的单次运行；第 X "
"部分给出了表格和方法。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:604
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "局限"

#: ../../cluster.rst:607
msgid ""
"We list the known gaps of each record. They are taken from the records "
"and are not repaired at the time of writing."
msgstr "我们列出每条记录的已知不足。它们取自这些记录，在撰写本书时尚未修复。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:609
msgid ""
"**SID 0022, bans and commands.** A ban issued after a lift holds on every "
"node only when it ends after the lifted ban would have; a shorter ban "
"holds on its own node only. Bans that the policy file configures are not "
"sent. The nodes must agree on ``ipv6_prefix`` and keep their clocks "
"close, and neither is checked; a node more than 60 seconds behind has its "
"commands overruled, and one more than 60 seconds ahead has them refused. "
"A ban whose three sends are lost to a peer cut off for less than three "
"probe periods waits for the next walk. The map of commands never forgets "
"a key, and after 8,192 keys new commands stay local until a restart. Two "
"operators who add one server name with two addresses at once can leave "
"the nodes disagreeing until the next command. Pools that place clients by "
"a Maglev table take no weights or members at run time. Commands and lifts "
"have no metrics. The process tests run on one host; the three-host timing "
"of Part X is the only measurement across hosts. Replication runs in edge "
"mode only."
msgstr ""
"**SID 0022，封禁与命令。** "
"在解除之后签发的封禁，只有当它的结束时间晚于被解除的封禁本应结束的时间时，才在每个节点上有效；较短的封禁只在其自身节点上有效。策略文件配置的封禁不会被发送。各节点必须在 "
"``ipv6_prefix`` 上保持一致并保持时钟接近，而这两点都不会被检查；落后 60 秒以上的节点的命令会被推翻，超前 60 "
"秒以上的节点的命令会被拒绝。如果一个封禁的三次发送都因对等节点被隔离不到三个探测周期而丢失，它要等待下一次逐项发送。命令映射从不遗忘键，达到 "
"8,192 个键之后，新命令在重启之前只在本地有效。两个运维人员同时以两个地址添加同一个服务器名称，可能使各节点在下一条命令之前不一致。按 "
"Maglev 表放置客户端的服务器池在运行时不接受权重和成员的修改。命令和解除没有指标。进程测试在一台主机上运行；第 X "
"部分的三主机计时是唯一的跨主机测量。复制只在边缘模式下运行。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:611
msgid ""
"**SID 0023, one file.** Files that the topology names by path, and files "
"that a JLV file imports, are not sent. A node that was down keeps its old "
"file until the command runs again. The stamp of the last file lives in "
"memory, so after a restart a node accepts a message of the last 60 "
"seconds again. A node is known by the source address of the connection. "
"The transfer is authenticated and not encrypted."
msgstr ""
"**SID 0023，一个文件。** 拓扑按路径引用的文件，以及 JLV "
"文件导入的文件，不会被发送。宕机的节点保留旧文件，直到该命令再次运行。上一个文件的时间戳保存在内存中，因此重启后节点会再次接受最近 60 "
"秒内的消息。节点由连接的源地址识别。传输经过认证，但不加密。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:613
msgid ""
"**SID 0025, affinity and caps.** The share of a stopped node does not "
"return after any bound; a cluster that starts with one node missing "
"serves no flow on a capped server; a node that restarts while a peer is "
"silent serves only on loans. The ledger is in memory only. The roster is "
"fixed for the life of a process. The table has no metrics series; ``show "
"affinity`` is the only view. A table keyed by a cookie reads the "
"``Cookie`` field only, so the first request of a session is balanced and "
"not remembered. A status can be replayed within one epoch. The process "
"tests run on loopback without loss, and no test cuts the network between "
"running processes. A client that uses two nodes within the replication "
"window, under 50 ms on two hosts, can meet two servers."
msgstr ""
"**SID 0025，会话保持与上限。** "
"已停止节点的份额在任何时限之后都不会归还；缺少一个节点就启动的集群不会在受上限约束的服务器上服务任何流；在某个对等节点静默时重启的节点只能依靠借来的份额提供服务。账本只保存在内存中。成员名单在进程的生命周期内固定。这张表没有指标序列；``show "
"affinity`` 是唯一的查看方式。以 Cookie 为键的表只读取 ``Cookie`` "
"字段，因此一个会话的第一个请求会被均衡而不会被记住。在一个纪元内，状态可以被重放。进程测试在没有丢失的回环接口上运行，没有任何测试在运行中的进程之间切断网络。在复制窗口内（两台主机上低于 "
"50 ms）使用两个节点的客户端可能遇到两台服务器。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:615
msgid ""
"**SID 0026, forwarding.** An established TCP connection breaks when the "
"router moves its packets to another node. HTTP/3 and frontends with "
"``proxy_protocol`` are not forwarded. Forwarding stops outside the "
"regional regime. Under ``global.reuse_port`` an old and a new process "
"share the forwarding port and may find each other dead for a while. "
"Builds other than Linux do not bind the forwarding connection to the mesh "
"address and are not tested. All tests and measurements ran on loopback, "
"and the deny status, the bound ``max_flows_per_peer``, the refusal of a "
"draining owner and the ten-second end of silent relays have no process "
"test. A forwarded datagram can be replayed within an epoch."
msgstr ""
"**SID 0026，转发。** 当路由器把已建立 TCP 连接的数据包转到另一个节点时，该连接会中断。HTTP/3 和带 "
"``proxy_protocol`` 的前端不会被转发。在区域模式之外，转发停止。在 ``global.reuse_port`` "
"下，新旧进程共享转发端口，可能有一段时间互相认为对方已失效。Linux "
"以外的构建不把转发连接绑定到网格地址，也未经测试。所有测试和测量都在回环接口上运行；拒绝状态、``max_flows_per_peer`` "
"上限、正在排空的所有者的拒绝，以及静默中继的十秒终止都没有进程测试。在一个纪元内，转发的数据报可以被重放。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:617
msgid ""
"**SID 0027, the spill cache.** A memory limit below the size of the file "
"kills the daemon or stalls the disk tier. A truncation of the file or a "
"read error of the disk raises a signal that ends the daemon, and so does "
"a full compressing or copy-on-write file system, which we do not detect. "
"The cache has not run under Docker or Kubernetes. The store that joins "
"the tiers was reviewed by its author only, and its marks are not tested "
"with several workers at once. The first flow of a client after a restart "
"goes without its hint. One storage thread serves one to three million "
"operations a second and sheds beyond that. The checksum is not keyed. "
"There is no test of a loss of power, and the 50-million-key qualification "
"of SID 0015 is not run. A ``spill`` section without a pool that uses the "
"table costs the file and does nothing, without a warning."
msgstr ""
"**SID 0027，溢出缓存。** "
"低于文件大小的内存限制会杀死守护进程或使磁盘层停滞。文件被截断或磁盘读取错误会引发一个信号，使守护进程终止；压缩或写时复制文件系统被写满时也是如此，而我们检测不到这种情况。该缓存尚未在 "
"Docker 或 Kubernetes 下运行过。连接两层的存储只经过其作者审查，其标记也未在多个 worker "
"同时运行时测试。重启后客户端的第一个流没有提示可用。一个存储线程每秒处理一百万到三百万次操作，超出部分被丢弃。校验和不带密钥。没有断电测试，SID "
"0015 的五千万键鉴定也尚未运行。没有任何服务器池使用该表的 ``spill`` 部分会占用文件而毫无作用，并且没有警告。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:619
msgid ""
"**SID 0028, the database.** The history is never pruned. Two nodes with "
"the same name overwrite each other's report. ``global``, ``mesh`` and "
"``observability`` cannot be published. There is no staged rollout, and "
"``apply`` does not wait for the nodes. A run-time change is not a "
"revision, and the next revision replaces it. SQLite has no notification. "
"A node with both a mesh and a database, and TLS to PostgreSQL, are not "
"tested through the binary. Only Linux is tested."
msgstr ""
"**SID 0028，数据库。** 历史从不修剪。两个同名节点会相互覆盖对方的报告。``global``、``mesh`` 和 "
"``observability`` 无法发布。没有分阶段发布，``apply`` "
"也不等待各节点。运行时修改不是修订版本，下一个修订版本会替换它。SQLite 没有通知机制。同时带网格和数据库的节点，以及到 PostgreSQL "
"的 TLS，未通过二进制程序测试。只在 Linux 上测试过。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:621
msgid ""
"**SID 0029, the upgrade.** Adopted UDP mappings are outside the count of "
"a fleet-wide cap. A mapping that a peer forwarded is answered directly "
"after the handoff. The mesh socket, the listener for cluster "
"configuration and the forwarding port are not passed, so a node of a mesh "
"cannot be replaced this way. QUIC connections end with the old process. A "
"connection that sends its first request more than 200 ms after the "
"cutover may be closed by the drain. A crash of the replacement after DONE "
"is an outage until the supervisor restarts it. There is no ``sd_notify``. "
"Several paths, a real second user, more than 6,000 mappings, and "
"``reuse_port`` beside the new key, are untested. The signal to a silent "
"replacement uses a process id, which the kernel can reuse."
msgstr ""
"**SID 0029，升级。** 被接管的 UDP "
"映射不计入集群范围上限的计数。对等节点转发来的映射在交接后被直接应答。网格套接字、集群配置的监听器和转发端口不会被传递，因此网格中的节点无法用这种方式替换。QUIC "
"连接随旧进程结束。在切换后超过 200 ms 才发送第一个请求的连接可能会被排空关闭。替代进程在 DONE "
"之后崩溃会造成中断，直到监管程序重启它。没有 ``sd_notify``。多条路径、真实的第二个用户、超过 6,000 个映射，以及与新密钥并存的 "
"``reuse_port`` 都未经测试。发给静默替代进程的信号使用进程 ID，而内核可能复用该 ID。"

#: ../../cluster.rst:623
msgid ""
"**SID 0031, the console.** The overhead criterion is not established. A "
"member that joins is used after a restart only. The console does not "
"terminate TLS and needs a proxy in front for its peers. The node commands "
"of the firewall page do nothing on an edge. No test runs a fleet of 64. "
"The fleet view holds a request thread for up to five seconds when a "
"member is silent, and shows at most 256 servers. The console threads are "
"not pinned to processors of their own."
msgstr ""
"**SID 0031，控制台。** 开销标准尚未确立。新加入的成员只有在重启后才会被使用。控制台不终止 "
"TLS，需要在前面放一个代理以供其对等节点使用。防火墙页面的节点命令在边缘上不起作用。没有测试运行过 64 "
"个成员的集群。当某个成员静默时，集群视图会占住一个请求线程至多五秒，并且最多显示 256 台服务器。控制台线程没有绑定到专属的处理器上。"
